{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32513","headline":"送李垣先辈归嵩少旧居 · 刘驾","name":"送李垣先辈归嵩少旧居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"高秋灞滻路，游子多惨戚。\n君於此地行，独以寻春色。\n文章满人口，高第非苟得。\n要路在长安，归山却爲客。\n□□□□□，狂歌罢叹息。\n我岂无故山，千里同外国。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘驾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32513.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32513","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}